e,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/82","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/milestone/82","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/82/labels","id":5835550,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNTgzNTU1MA==","number":82,"title":"1.8.0.Final","description":"","creator":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":72,"state":"closed","created_at":"2020-09-02T08:17:51Z","updated_at":"2020-11-27T19:18:33Z","due_on":"2020-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2020-09-15T13:28:40Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2020-09-08T09:27:19Z","updated_at":"2020-10-13T09:51:01Z","closed_at":"2020-09-08T17:01:17Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\n`quarkus.kubernetes-config.secrets.enabled` takes precedence over `quarkus.kubernetes-config.enabled`. When `quarkus.kubernetes-config.secrets.enabled=true` and `quarkus.kubernetes-config.enabled=false`, Quarkus application will still try to get configuration from secrets.\r\n\r\nThis is a change of behaviour compared to Quarkus 1.7.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nWhen `quarkus.kubernetes-config.enabled=false`, Quarkus app should not be attempting to get configuration from Kubernetes API server.\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\nWhen `quarkus.kubernetes-config.enabled=false` and `quarkus.kubernetes-config.secrets.enabled=true`, Quarkus app attempts to get configuration from secrets from Kubernetes API server.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. Check out https://github.com/quarkus-qe/quarkus-openshift-test-suite\r\n2. `mvn clean test -pl config-secret/api-server/ -Dquarkus-core-only` The unit test will fail as it is attempting to reach Kubernetes server it should not be.\r\n3. `mvn clean test -pl config-secret/api-server/ -Dquarkus-core-only -Dversion.quarkus=1.7.2.Final` The unit test passes.\r\n\r\n**Configuration**\r\n```properties\r\nquarkus.kubernetes-config.enabled=true\r\nquarkus.kubernetes-config.secrets.enabled=true\r\nquarkus.kubernetes-config.secrets=app-config\r\n\r\n%test.quarkus.kubernetes-config.enabled=false\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: `Linux tigris 5.8.4-200.fc32.x86_64 #1 SMP Wed Aug 26 22:28:08 UTC 2020 x86_64 x86_64 x86_64 GNU/Linux`\r\n - Output of `java -version`: `openjdk version \"11.0.8\" 2020-07-14`\r\n - GraalVM version (if different from Java): N/A\r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: `724047de11bd2aea3de2d38928669c92a2e149c2`\r\n - Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`):  `Apache Maven 3.6.3 (cecedd343002696d0abb50b32b541b8a6ba2883f)`\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_